    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6d763108223a849c3f22bea8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "对一般大众来说，今晚是圣诞节。\n不过对即将迎来重大比赛“有马纪念”\n的赛马娘来说，这是不能玩太疯的一晚。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a33dcc9253b400bf72b15e57885d6adf9c3b51c97324e2107704e679a9c843e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1006/storytimeline_501006109.json",
