    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49206b37b4da5c3559c6154b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但是，今晚毫无疑问是个珍贵的夜晚。\n我告诉小栗帽，\n要她也去和朋友好好玩乐一番──",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ce6eafb7e751894d0a9fbef15c1df9961d1b690ae829298fb958e8353213548",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
